    "the web_ui SettingsPage containers (data-section / data-testid), `dart` +",
    "`dartMarker` pin the desktop home (file + a string that must appear in it),",
    "`webMarker` pins the string the web control renders. Guards:",
    "test/hygiene/settings_parity_manifest_test.dart (Dart side) and",
    "web_ui/src/pages/SettingsPage.parity.test.tsx (web side + section order)."
